t my controller is now detected! \nUsing an 8BitDo pro 2 wired controller in D-Input mode (hold b when connecting the controller)\n\nSomething weird though is that the mappings are all screwed up \n(ie Godot thinks L-Bumper is start, and start is D-Pad up, and the triggers are flipped among other issues). \n\nNo idea what's going on there, it could be the controller. I was able to fix it by re-mapping using [gamepad-tool](https://generalarcade.com/gamepadtool/) and fixing my mappings with the env variable.","author_association":"NONE","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3498500670/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3512998312","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/102927#issuecomment-3512998312","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/102927","id":3512998312,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc7RZBmo","user":{"login":"Nintorch","id":92302738,"node_id":"U_kgDOBYBtkg","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/92302738?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Nintorch","html_url":"https://github.com/Nintorch","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Nintorch/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Nintorch/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Nintorch/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Nintorch/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Nintorch/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Nintorch/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Nintorch/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Nintorch/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Nintorch/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":